== diags.diag/mutated-while-borrowed
BYN3004 5:5 `xs` is modified while `view` still borrows it
  label `view` is used again on line 6
  help finish using `view` first, or copy what it needs before changing `xs`
BYN3004 8:5 `xs` is modified while `again` still borrows it
  label `again` is used again on line 9
  help finish using `again` first, or copy what it needs before changing `xs`
BYN3004 11:9 `xs` is modified while the `for` loop still borrows it
  label the loop over `xs` is still running
  help collect the changes in another list and apply them to `xs` after the loop
BYN3004 15:5 `arena` is modified while `name` still borrows it
  label `name` is used again on line 16
  help finish using `name` first, or copy what it needs before changing `arena`
